  "covConsentTitle": "Share your coverage?",
  "covConsentBody": "NOTORYX PRO will send these to coverage.meshmayhem.org, only for hexagons (about 0.7 km² each) where your radio heard a repeater directly:\n\n• the hexagon, its 15-minute time slot, how many packets were heard, and the best SNR and RSSI\n• the repeaters heard directly there (their short hop codes) and their best SNR\n• the MeshCore repeaters your radio knows, with the positions they advertise themselves\n• a coverage key made only for this, never your radio's identity, and your mapper name if you set one\n\nIt never sends your GPS track or exact position, your messages, your contacts or your radio's name. The first 2 and last 2 hexagons of each drive stay on this phone. Uploads wait 3 hours and use Wi-Fi only unless you change that. Anonymous sends no key, no name and no repeater list, and only the date.\n\nYou can stop sharing or erase your uploads at any time.",
